flowchart TD
    A[Position counter] --> B{Reference LOW -> HIGH?}
    B -->|Yes| C[REF_START = position]
    B -->|No| D{Reference HIGH -> LOW?}
    D -->|Yes| E{REF_START valid?}
    E -->|Yes| F[REF_END = position]
    F --> G[REF_LENGTH = absolute difference]
    E -->|No| H[ignore]
    D -->|No| I[continue]
